<title>USA: Nam Corp says Giuliani-Rheaume named CFO.</title>
<headline>Nam Corp says Giuliani-Rheaume named CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAM Corp said Tuesday Patricia Giuliani-Rheaume has joined the company as Vice President/Treasurer and Chief Financial Officer.</p>
<p>She succeeds Charles Merola, who resigned from his role as CFO and a member of the board of directors, NAM said.</p>
<p>Giuliani-Rheaume was previously vice president and corporate controller at the Robert Plan Corp.</p>
